{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Path of the Zenith Master is an action-adventure game.</strong><i>Once a disciple of a reclusive mountain clan, you are chosen to forge your own path to mastery when your clan faces imminent peril. Through trials of fire and steel, transform into the unyielding pillar that safeguards your ancestral stronghold.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the secret realm of the sect and experience an all-new martial journey lasting approximately 2-3 hours. This trial version unlocks about one-third of the main storyline of the full game, offering a glimpse into the peril and grandeur of the path to mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200b[Trial Version Core Content]\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Immersive Eastern Martial Arts Experience: Feel the essence of &quot;offense-defense unity&quot; in combat\u2014every attack can transition into defense, every block can brew a counterattack. Master the &quot;Momentum Break: Guard&quot; system to seize opportunities to defeat enemies amidst clashing blades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 11 Meticulously Designed Trial Stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Five Character Skills: The trial version offers 5 character skills, which can be learned as you level up.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4017130?t=1758788048","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017130/69136fc43270b4bd06acc7223a9167963efb17d9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758788048","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017130/835ffcfd21d9678cea9ef50994f71b386f777bf8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758788048","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017130/835ffcfd21d9678cea9ef50994f71b386f777bf8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758788048","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Path of the Zenith Master is an action-adventure game.</strong><i>Once a disciple of a reclusive mountain clan, you are chosen to forge your own path to mastery when your clan faces imminent peril. Through trials of fire and steel, transform into the unyielding pillar that safeguards your ancestral stronghold.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the secret realm of the sect and experience an all-new martial journey lasting approximately 2-3 hours. This trial version unlocks about one-third of the main storyline of the full game, offering a glimpse into the peril and grandeur of the path to mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200b[Trial Version Core Content]\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Immersive Eastern Martial Arts Experience: Feel the essence of &quot;offense-defense unity&quot; in combat\u2014every attack can transition into defense, every block can brew a counterattack. Master the &quot;Momentum Break: Guard&quot; system to seize opportunities to defeat enemies amidst clashing blades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 11 Meticulously Designed Trial Stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Five Character Skills: The trial version offers 5 character skills, which can be learned as you level up.</p>","developers":["\u5341\u5e74"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3867390","name":"Path of the Zenith Master"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017130/e7b3c6f750ca6fe7e872aea46f5cf22ee87f66f5/header.jpg?t=1758788048","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4017130/1112163996